   },
   {
    "s": "First: If + present, will + V",
    "uz": "real kelajak imkoniyati",
    "ex": "If governments invest in transport, traffic will decrease.",
    "use": "Task 2 natija"
   },
   {
    "s": "Second: If + past, would + V",
    "uz": "xayoliy yoki kam ehtimolli holat",
    "ex": "If I had more time, I would learn Korean.",
    "use": "Speaking Part 3 faraz savollari"
   },
   {
    "s": "Third: If + had V3, would have V3",
    "uz": "o'tmishdagi xayoliy holat (afsus)",
    "ex": "If I had started earlier, I would have got a 7.",
    "use": "Speaking hikoyalar"
   },
   {
    "s": "Mixed: If + had V3, would + V (now)",
    "uz": "o'tmish sabab, hozirgi natija",
